				"2645C1A262AC779D"
			]
			description: [
				"You can grind down gravel directly into flint with this. It's also used for making various dusts, which will prove rather useful in the kinetic age."
				""
				"You do need to smooth out some stone first, though. You can do that by smelting cobblestone on a campfire... And cobblestone can be crafted from the rocks you can find on the surface."
			]
			id: "014B4B05C0DC4FFB"
			subtitle: "Easier flint!"
