		{
			dependencies: ["0316B6F51FF38751"]
			description: [
				"This needs copper sheets now! Thankfully, once you have this you can actually melt metal into proper molds, which means you won't lose nearly as much material as before."
				""
				"As an added bonus, this furnace can reach much higher temperatures, enough to process most ores!"
