				"76B70EF552B35779"
				"2645C1A262AC779D"
			]
			description: [
				"If you've gone down to the deepslate layer, you might have noticed that you cannot breathe there! To do that, you'll need one of these."
				""
				"Later on, you can replace it with a create diving suit, if you so wish. Space helmets and the gregtech power armours provide the same functionality, too!"
				""
				"Take a look at the steam age to see how to make paper!"
				""
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You might want to enchant your respirator with unbreaking and mending, once you have those enchantments on your hands that is."
				""
				"You can also try making an air bladder to restore some of your air meter."
