		{
			dependencies: ["2674BDB01B431D20"]
			description: [
				"To cook anything of value, you will need to do some shenanigans first. At the moment, this is your only way of smelting stuff."
				""
				"First, craft a fire starter. Then, drop a log and 3 pieces of kindling (sticks, saplings, leaves, string...) on the same block. Now, hold right click on the items with your firestarter and hope for the best!"
				""
				"Also, breaking the campfire gives you some charcoal that you aren't supposed to have yet, but shhh! You didn't hear that from me!"
			]
			id: "2645C1A262AC779D"
