		{
			dependencies: ["0316B6F51FF38751"]
			description: [
				"Your next step is a copper pickaxe, which will let you harvest raw ore. Raw ore gives you significantly more useable copper than crushed ore when processed on the campfire!"
				""
				"While you can skip to a mining hammer, it is not recommended. A pickaxe will let you get a much more stable source of copper at first."
