			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["63361EFFEE5FAE29"]
			description: [
				"Your first crafting tool! This thing will be used mostly to compress ingots into plates early on. "
				""
				"An important fact about the hammer is that you can &2use it like a pickaxe&r, but it will crush the ore instead of just harvesting it. This can be a great way to get some extra copper going from a vein close to the surface, despite the fragmented ores being a little less suited for your primitive process."
				""
				"Technically, you can already invest into some gregtech tools, but the only ones that I will actually recommend making right now are the pickaxe and the mining hammer. Perhaps you'll get some use out of a saw, too!"
			]
			id: "0316B6F51FF38751"
