		{
			dependencies: ["41730E340B3D8EDA"]
			description: [
				"With gregtech 1.5, visual prospecting is back! You might have noticed that when you right click an indicator pile, you get notified about prospecting a new vein. On your map (J by default) you'll be able to turn on \"GT ore veins\" to view icons for the veins you've found on the map."
				""
				"You can also mark veins by mining the ores, right clicking on the ore blocks, or using your prospector scanner."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"It's a little finnicky, but you can also right click on those and then \"toggle waypoint\" in the menu, which will place an in-world waypoint in the place where that vein is. Super convenient!"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:prospector.lv"
			id: "211A9C00AC6E1E20"
			subtitle: "Ough, finally no manual waypoints!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "347A268A63ED4311"
				title: "New prospecting"
